    "type": "game",
    "name": "Run Pizza Run 2",
    "steam_appid": 3320540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/d03c8f7ae0785a72e0db262e934fa46d.avif?t=1740675516\" width=560 height=164 /></span><strong><br>Run Pizza Run 2</strong> returns with even more fun and challenges! The second installment of the game takes you into a new world of chaotic online competitions, where every move can be decisive. Forget about calm pizza deliveries \u2014 now it's not just about your order, but the title of the best delivery driver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/0d5ae370c23ac72f7afb9b2b00a373d2.poster.avif?t=1740675516\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/0d5ae370c23ac72f7afb9b2b00a373d2.webm?t=1740675516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/0d5ae370c23ac72f7afb9b2b00a373d2.mp4?t=1740675516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will find exciting multiplayer modes where you can compete with friends or random players from around the world. Dynamic maps with various obstacles and unique victory conditions await you: from time races to battles for the title of the most agile driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is a new challenge where you\u2019ll have to maneuver through traffic, jump over gaps, and, of course, avoid falls and unexpected collisions. Agility, speed, and strategy are what set real champions apart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/f14c6ca7460f0cb737998b5c953ac965.poster.avif?t=1740675516\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/f14c6ca7460f0cb737998b5c953ac965.webm?t=1740675516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/f14c6ca7460f0cb737998b5c953ac965.mp4?t=1740675516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the classic mode, Run Pizza Run 2 introduces strategic elements, turning every delivery into a test of wit and quick reflexes. Only the most agile and fastest will become legends of this chaotic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fun, challenge your friends, or face off against strangers and become the one remembered as the best delivery driver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/d03c8f7ae0785a72e0db262e934fa46d.avif?t=1740675516\" width=560 height=164 /></span><strong><br>Run Pizza Run 2</strong> returns with even more fun and challenges! The second installment of the game takes you into a new world of chaotic online competitions, where every move can be decisive. Forget about calm pizza deliveries \u2014 now it's not just about your order, but the title of the best delivery driver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/0d5ae370c23ac72f7afb9b2b00a373d2.poster.avif?t=1740675516\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/0d5ae370c23ac72f7afb9b2b00a373d2.webm?t=1740675516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/0d5ae370c23ac72f7afb9b2b00a373d2.mp4?t=1740675516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will find exciting multiplayer modes where you can compete with friends or random players from around the world. Dynamic maps with various obstacles and unique victory conditions await you: from time races to battles for the title of the most agile driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is a new challenge where you\u2019ll have to maneuver through traffic, jump over gaps, and, of course, avoid falls and unexpected collisions. Agility, speed, and strategy are what set real champions apart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/f14c6ca7460f0cb737998b5c953ac965.poster.avif?t=1740675516\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/f14c6ca7460f0cb737998b5c953ac965.webm?t=1740675516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320540/extras/f14c6ca7460f0cb737998b5c953ac965.mp4?t=1740675516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the classic mode, Run Pizza Run 2 introduces strategic elements, turning every delivery into a test of wit and quick reflexes. Only the most agile and fastest will become legends of this chaotic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fun, challenge your friends, or face off against strangers and become the one remembered as the best delivery driver!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Online pizza delivery simulator! Deliver pizzas, compete with friends, and conquer a chaotic online world full of obstacles and unexpected challenges. New maps, modes, and tons of fun await you! Ready to become the best delivery driver? Embrace the chaos!",
